        {
          "text": "anyika mbiibede, na njambolezi na njankanda, alimwi na muli misamu mulinjiyo na pe. Amu-yume, mukalete imwi micelo yamunyika, Lino ciindi eco cakali ciindi camasaansa naatalika kubizwa.",
