        {
          "text": "Aboobo bakaletela bana baIsrayeli impuwo imbi yanyika eyo njibakaakutwela, Bakati, Nyika eyo njitwakaakutwela ninyika iikonzya kulya bantu bayo, abantu boonse mbetwakabona nkuko majompojompo. ",
